'''Tech''' may refer to:

== Items ==
* {{i|Technology}}, a passive item that replaces tears with lasers.
* {{i|Technology 2}}, a passive item that adds a continuous laser alongside Isaac's tears.
* {{i|Tech.5}}, a passive item that adds a random chance to fire lasers.
* {{i|Tech X}}, a passive item that replaces tears with laser rings.
* {{i|Technology Zero}}, a passive item that connects Isaac's tears with electricity.
* {{dlc|r}} Any <code>[[Item_Tags_tech|'tech']]</code> tagged item.

== Notes ==
* {{dlc+|a+nr}} Technology items contribute towards the {{a|Technology Zero}} unlock.{{dlc-}}
* {{dlc+|r}} The full list of <code>'tech'</code> tagged items are used for the purposes of unlocking {{a|Technology Zero}}.{{dlc-}}

